Matrix Builds in GitHub Actions

Today I learned how matrix builds help test applications across multiple environments in a single workflow.

🔹 Build Matrix Concept
A build matrix allows running the same job with:
Different OS
Different language versions
Multiple configurations
This avoids duplicating workflows.

🔹 Multiple OS / Versions
Matrix builds are commonly used for:
Linux, Windows, macOS
Multiple runtime versions
This ensures broad compatibility.

🔹 Parallel Testing
Matrix jobs run in parallel
Faster feedback
Better test coverage
Parallelism improves CI efficiency.

🔥 3-Line Takeaway
Matrix expands coverage.
 Parallel saves time.
 One workflow scales testing.
